{"id":260,"date":"2026-10-01T15:41:55","date_gmt":"2026-10-01T15:41:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/dental-and-oral-health\/","raw":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/dental-and-oral-health\/"},"modified":"2026-10-07T18:20:43","modified_gmt":"2026-10-07T18:20:43","password":"","slug":"dental-and-oral-health","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/dental-and-oral-health\/","title":{"raw":"Dental and Oral Health","rendered":"Dental and Oral Health"},"content":{"raw":"<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">A healthy, natural-looking smile supports both your well-being and your confidence. MedLuxLife connects you with experienced dental specialists who combine modern digital diagnostics with proven treatment methods, from a single implant to a complete smile makeover.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":295,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hero-1024x966.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling patient during a dental check-up\" class=\"wp-image-295\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dental treatments<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":296,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hollywood-smile-1024x348.jpg\" alt=\"Man with a bright, even smile at the dentist\" class=\"wp-image-296\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hollywood Smile<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A complete smile makeover designed to create a bright, even and harmonious smile that suits your facial features. Depending on your needs, it can combine:<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Teeth whitening<\/strong> for an even, natural brightness<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Veneers<\/strong> in porcelain or zirconium to correct discolouration, chips or minor misalignment<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Dental bonding<\/strong> to repair small flaws or gaps<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Contouring and reshaping<\/strong> for symmetry and balance<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Gum contouring<\/strong> for an even gum line<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":298,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implants-563x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Dentist showing a dental implant model to a patient\" class=\"wp-image-298\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dental Implants<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A permanent solution for missing or damaged teeth. A titanium or other biocompatible implant is placed in the jawbone, where it integrates over time and forms a stable base for a crown, bridge or denture.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Looks and feels like a natural tooth<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Restores full chewing function<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Long-lasting with proper care<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Helps preserve the jawbone<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":294,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-all-on-4-1024x920.jpg\" alt=\"Illustration of dental implants supporting crowns\" class=\"wp-image-294\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">All-on-4 and All-on-6<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fixed full-arch solutions for patients who are missing most or all of their teeth. A complete set of upper or lower teeth is supported by four or six implants. In many cases temporary teeth can be fitted on the same day.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All-on-6 may be recommended where more stability is needed or bone loss is more advanced. Your dentist will advise which option suits you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":299,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-prosthetics-1024x873.jpg\" alt=\"Digitally produced dental prosthesis on a model\" class=\"wp-image-299\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prosthetic Dental Treatments<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Aesthetic and functional solutions for missing teeth, including fixed crowns and bridges placed over natural teeth.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":297,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implant-supported-prostheses-1024x910.jpg\" alt=\"Dentist explaining an implant to a patient in the treatment chair\" class=\"wp-image-297\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Implant-Supported Prostheses<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Fixed or removable prostheses attached to implants in the jawbone, offering better stability and comfort than conventional dentures.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":300,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-teeth-whitening-557x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Professional teeth whitening with blue light\" class=\"wp-image-300\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Teeth Whitening<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A cosmetic treatment that lightens the colour of the teeth and removes stains and discolouration.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Zirconium Veneers<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Custom-made restorations in zirconia ceramic that improve the shape and colour of your teeth while looking natural.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Very strong and resistant to chipping and staining<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Suitable for patients who grind their teeth<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Metal-free and hypoallergenic<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Periodontology (Gum Treatment)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Healthy teeth need healthy gums. Gum inflammation (gingivitis) and advanced gum disease (periodontitis) are treated with professional cleaning, scaling and root planing and, where necessary, surgical procedures to protect the gums and bone.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Restorative Dental Treatments<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Repair of damaged or decayed teeth, for example with fillings, to restore their function, structure and appearance.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Root Canal Treatment<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Cleaning and sealing the inflamed or damaged nerve tissue inside a tooth, so the natural tooth can be saved instead of extracted.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Masseter Botox (Jaw Botox)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Injections into the masseter muscle can ease teeth grinding (bruxism) and jaw tension and give the lower face a slimmer, more oval contour. A quick treatment whose effect typically lasts 4 to 6 months.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">TMJ Treatment<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Treatment of pain, clicking or locking of the jaw joint, which is often linked to teeth grinding. Night guards (splints) protect the joint and relax the muscles; surgical options are available where needed.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Orthodontics<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Braces and clear aligners correct crooked, crowded or gapped teeth. Options for all ages include metal or tooth-coloured brackets and discreet clear aligner systems.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your dental treatment with confidence<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/contact\/\">Request a Free Consultation<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->","rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">A healthy, natural-looking smile supports both your well-being and your confidence. MedLuxLife connects you with experienced dental specialists who combine modern digital diagnostics with proven treatment methods, from a single implant to a complete smile makeover.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"966\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hero-1024x966.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling patient during a dental check-up\" class=\"wp-image-295\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hero-1024x966.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hero-300x283.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hero-768x725.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hero-1536x1450.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hero-13x12.jpg 13w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hero.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dental treatments<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"348\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hollywood-smile-1024x348.jpg\" alt=\"Man with a bright, even smile at the dentist\" class=\"wp-image-296\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hollywood-smile-1024x348.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hollywood-smile-300x102.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hollywood-smile-768x261.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hollywood-smile-1536x523.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hollywood-smile-18x6.jpg 18w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-hollywood-smile.jpg 1599w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hollywood Smile<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A complete smile makeover designed to create a bright, even and harmonious smile that suits your facial features. Depending on your needs, it can combine:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Teeth whitening<\/strong> for an even, natural brightness<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Veneers<\/strong> in porcelain or zirconium to correct discolouration, chips or minor misalignment<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Dental bonding<\/strong> to repair small flaws or gaps<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Contouring and reshaping<\/strong> for symmetry and balance<\/li>\n\n<li><strong>Gum contouring<\/strong> for an even gum line<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"563\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implants-563x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Dentist showing a dental implant model to a patient\" class=\"wp-image-298\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implants-563x1024.jpg 563w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implants-165x300.jpg 165w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implants-768x1398.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implants-844x1536.jpg 844w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implants-7x12.jpg 7w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implants.jpg 879w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 563px) 100vw, 563px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dental Implants<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A permanent solution for missing or damaged teeth. A titanium or other biocompatible implant is placed in the jawbone, where it integrates over time and forms a stable base for a crown, bridge or denture.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Looks and feels like a natural tooth<\/li>\n\n<li>Restores full chewing function<\/li>\n\n<li>Long-lasting with proper care<\/li>\n\n<li>Helps preserve the jawbone<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"920\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-all-on-4-1024x920.jpg\" alt=\"Illustration of dental implants supporting crowns\" class=\"wp-image-294\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-all-on-4-1024x920.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-all-on-4-300x270.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-all-on-4-768x690.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-all-on-4-13x12.jpg 13w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-all-on-4.jpg 1345w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">All-on-4 and All-on-6<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fixed full-arch solutions for patients who are missing most or all of their teeth. A complete set of upper or lower teeth is supported by four or six implants. In many cases temporary teeth can be fitted on the same day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All-on-6 may be recommended where more stability is needed or bone loss is more advanced. Your dentist will advise which option suits you.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"873\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-prosthetics-1024x873.jpg\" alt=\"Digitally produced dental prosthesis on a model\" class=\"wp-image-299\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-prosthetics-1024x873.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-prosthetics-300x256.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-prosthetics-768x655.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-prosthetics-14x12.jpg 14w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-prosthetics.jpg 1347w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Prosthetic Dental Treatments<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Aesthetic and functional solutions for missing teeth, including fixed crowns and bridges placed over natural teeth.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"910\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implant-supported-prostheses-1024x910.jpg\" alt=\"Dentist explaining an implant to a patient in the treatment chair\" class=\"wp-image-297\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implant-supported-prostheses-1024x910.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implant-supported-prostheses-300x267.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implant-supported-prostheses-768x682.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implant-supported-prostheses-14x12.jpg 14w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-implant-supported-prostheses.jpg 1443w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Implant-Supported Prostheses<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fixed or removable prostheses attached to implants in the jawbone, offering better stability and comfort than conventional dentures.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"557\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-teeth-whitening-557x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Professional teeth whitening with blue light\" class=\"wp-image-300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-teeth-whitening-557x1024.jpg 557w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-teeth-whitening-163x300.jpg 163w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-teeth-whitening-768x1412.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-teeth-whitening-835x1536.jpg 835w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-teeth-whitening-7x12.jpg 7w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-dental-teeth-whitening.jpg 870w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 557px) 100vw, 557px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Teeth Whitening<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A cosmetic treatment that lightens the colour of the teeth and removes stains and discolouration.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Zirconium Veneers<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Custom-made restorations in zirconia ceramic that improve the shape and colour of your teeth while looking natural.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Very strong and resistant to chipping and staining<\/li>\n\n<li>Suitable for patients who grind their teeth<\/li>\n\n<li>Metal-free and hypoallergenic<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Periodontology (Gum Treatment)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Healthy teeth need healthy gums. Gum inflammation (gingivitis) and advanced gum disease (periodontitis) are treated with professional cleaning, scaling and root planing and, where necessary, surgical procedures to protect the gums and bone.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Restorative Dental Treatments<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Repair of damaged or decayed teeth, for example with fillings, to restore their function, structure and appearance.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Root Canal Treatment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Cleaning and sealing the inflamed or damaged nerve tissue inside a tooth, so the natural tooth can be saved instead of extracted.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Masseter Botox (Jaw Botox)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Injections into the masseter muscle can ease teeth grinding (bruxism) and jaw tension and give the lower face a slimmer, more oval contour. A quick treatment whose effect typically lasts 4 to 6 months.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">TMJ Treatment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Treatment of pain, clicking or locking of the jaw joint, which is often linked to teeth grinding. Night guards (splints) protect the joint and relax the muscles; surgical options are available where needed.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Orthodontics<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Braces and clear aligners correct crooked, crowded or gapped teeth. Options for all ages include metal or tooth-coloured brackets and discreet clear aligner systems.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your dental treatment with confidence<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/contact\/\">Request a Free Consultation<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false,"block_version":1},"excerpt":{"raw":"Dental implants, Hollywood Smile, zirconium veneers, orthodontics and more, with experienced partner specialists and full travel coordination by MedLuxLife.","rendered":"<p>Dental implants, Hollywood Smile, zirconium veneers, orthodontics and more, with experienced partner specialists and full travel coordination by MedLuxLife.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":258,"menu_order":1,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-with-title","meta":{"footnotes":""},"permalink_template":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/health\/clinical-treatments\/%pagename%\/","generated_slug":"dental-and-oral-health","class_list":["post-260","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/260","targetHints":{"allow":["GET","POST","PUT","PATCH","DELETE"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=260"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/260\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":303,"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/260\/revisions\/303"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/258"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=260"}],"wp:action-publish":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/260"}],"wp:action-unfiltered-html":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/260"}],"wp:action-assign-author":[{"href":"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/260"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}